"description":"ShareMe – Chat & Transfer Files on Local Wi-Fi\n\nShareMe is a fast and secure local network file transfer app that lets you chat and share files between iPhone, Android, Mac, and Windows devices over the same Wi-Fi network.\n\nNo account. No cloud. No Internet upload. Just open ShareMe, discover nearby devices, and start chatting or transferring files instantly.\n\nKey Features\n\nDiscover Nearby Devices\n\n* Automatically scan devices on the same Wi-Fi network\n* Supports iPhone, Android, Mac, and Windows\n* One tap to start a conversation\n\nChat & Share\n\nCommunicate with nearby devices in real time while exchanging:\n\n* Text messages\n* Photos\n* Videos\n* Audio files\n* Documents\n* Clipboard content\n* Entire folders\n\nInstant Reconnection\n\nAfter your first conversation, your chat history is saved locally.\nAs long as both devices keep Sherit open in the foreground, you can reconnect instantly from the Chats tab without scanning again.\n\nYour Profile\n\nPersonalize your identity with:\n\n* Avatar\n* Nickname\n* Status message\n\nProfile updates are automatically visible to connected devices on the same network.\n\nSmart Receiving\n\nCustomize how incoming files are handled:\n\n* Confirm before receiving files\n* Automatically save photos\n* Automatically save videos\n\nFile History\n\nKeep track of transferred files and quickly access previous transfers.\n\nMore\n\n* Join our community\n* Reddit & Discord support\n* Send feedback\n* Rate the app\n* About\n\nWhy ShareMe?\n\n* Fast local Wi-Fi transfer\n* Cross-platform support\n* No account required\n* No cables needed\n* No cloud storage\n* No Internet upload\n* Private local communication\n* Simple and intuitive interface\n\nWhether you’re sending photos to your computer, sharing documents between phones, or transferring folders across different platforms, ShareMe makes local sharing effortless.", "bundleId":"com.sharedrop.wifiShare", "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"ShareMe: 