"description":"Fast, Private Local File Sharing.\n\nTransfer photos, videos, documents, folders, and more between your devices in seconds—without using the Internet or uploading your files to the cloud.\n\nFeem transfers files directly over your local Wi-Fi or personal hotspot. Your data stays on your network, giving you faster transfers, better privacy, and complete control over your files.\n\nDesigned for everyday sharing, Feem handles everything from a few photos to large folders and multi-gigabyte videos with ease.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Fast local file transfers\n• 100% private — your files never leave your network\n• Resume interrupted transfers automatically\n• Send large files and entire folders\n• Chat-style transfer history\n• Send and receive files at the same time\n• Experimental WebShare support\n• Simple, modern interface\n\nNO INTERNET REQUIRED\n\nAs long as your devices are connected to the same Wi-Fi network or personal hotspot, you're ready to transfer.\n\nNo cloud.\nNo cables.\nNo waiting.\n\nJust fast, private file sharing.\n\nLearn more at feem.io.", "bundleId":"com.feeperfect.feem.macos", "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"Feem - Transfer Files Offline", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/pt/app/feem-transfer-files-offline/id6475391304?mt=12&uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":0}, 
