"releaseNotes":"Free vs. Pro Reminder: Local File Sharing and Notification Mirroring are 100% free with zero ads. Upgrade to Pro only if you need desktop SMS, automatic clipboard sync, and remote file management.\n\nHere is what’s new in this version:\n• Fixed memory usage during large file transfers: Resolved an issue where sending massive files or folders between Mac, Android, and Windows would consume excessive memory.\n• Under-the-Hood Tuning: General stability patches and performance tweaks to ensure a lighter memory footprint on Apple Silicon and Intel Macs.\n\nIf EasyJoin makes your cross-platform setup easier, taking 10 seconds to leave us a rating or review helps an independent project immensely!", "minimumOsVersion":"12", "artistId":1841417088, "artistName":"Panagiotis Spiropoulos", "genres":["Utilitários", "Produtividade"], "releaseDate":"2025-10-19T07:00:00Z", "genreIds":["6002", "6007"], "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "sellerName":"Panagiotis Spiropoulos", "primaryGenreName":"Utilities", "primaryGenreId":6002, "trackName":"EasyJoin: File Transfer & Sync", "trackId":6752865855, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-07-11T15:49:04Z", "version":"4.4.2", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"EUR", 
"description":"Connect your Mac, Android, Windows, Linux and iOS devices without relying on the cloud. EasyJoin provides a direct, private link between your ecosystem. By utilizing your local network instead of external web servers, you can share data instantly without internet access, data tracking, or recurring monthly costs.\n\nEverything stays 100% encrypted and off the cloud. Whether you need a reliable AirDrop alternative for an Android phone or a way to manage your devices from a desktop, EasyJoin keeps your data exactly where it belongs: on your devices.\n\nCORE FEATURES (100% Free & Unlimited)\n• High-Speed File Transfer: Move individual files, photos, or entire folders over your local Wi-Fi. No file size caps, no compression, and zero internet bandwidth usage.\n• Notification Mirroring: See and interact with your phone's notifications (WhatsApp, Telegram, and system alerts) right on macOS. Stay updated without constantly checking your screen.\n• Offline Privacy: Your data never touches the internet. No external servers, no third-party tracking, and no cloud leaks.\n• Cross-Platform Freedom: A clean, unified bridge that links macOS, Android, Windows, Linux, and iOS devices together effortlessly.\n\nEASYJOIN PRO (Optional One-Time Purchase)\nUpgrade once to unlock advanced desktop productivity for life - no subscriptions required:\n• SMS from Mac: Read, reply, and send text messages directly from your computer using your phone’s mobile connection.\n• Universal Clipboard: Copy text or links on your Android device and paste them instantly on your Mac (and vice versa) without manual sending.\n• Remote File Management: Cleanly browse and organize your phone’s internal storage from your desktop interface to download, upload, or delete files.\n\nTHE LOCAL-FIRST DIFFERENCE\nUnlike cloud-reliant synchronization tools, EasyJoin is built from the ground up for strict privacy and hardware efficiency:\n• End-to-End Encryption: Every single data transfer is locked down within your own private Wi-Fi network.\n• Optimized for Mac: Native architecture built to run efficiently on Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3/M4/M5) with minimal battery impact.\n• Zero Accounts Required: No email sign-ups, no passwords, and no hidden tracking scripts. Install, pair, and start sharing in 30 seconds.\n\nStop paying monthly fees to transfer files across your own desk. Experience true cross-device continuity with total privacy. Download EasyJoin and take control of your data.\n\nSupport & Feedback\nQuestions or suggestions? Contact us at: info@easyjoin.net\nVisit our website: https://easyjoin.net", "bundleId":"net.easyjoin.mac.pro", "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"EasyJoin: File Transfer & Sync", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/pt/app/easyjoin-file-transfer-sync/id6752865855?mt=12&uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":0}]
